{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Are you my brother.</b> An expression of astonishment: is it because you are my brother that you would make me serve for nothing?" "<b>And you shall serve me.</b> Like וְתַעַבְדֵנִי; and so every word that is in the past tense — a vav is added at its head, and it turns the word into the future."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:05.049979122Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}